# NOTE: the per-question "Digital SAT-Style Solution, with Desmos" panel uses
# a Supabase Edge Function (supabase/functions/generate-desmos-solution) that
# calls the Anthropic API to tailor the write-up to each question's actual
# content. That key is an Edge Function secret, NOT a VITE_ variable — set it
# with:
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Without it, the panel automatically falls back to the generic built-in
# template instead of failing.

